      "en": "then his father and his mother shall take hold of him and bring him out to the elders of his city and to the gate of his place.",
      "ko": "그 부모가 그를 잡아가지고 성문에 이르러 그 성읍 장로들에게 나아가서",
      "source_text_hash": "2bef14b40014d17694555093397d7ecef41b1a8dd62341bcfd7a58ab54f36c88",
      "translation_text_hash": "7888743a80550e965d2bef9820a9ce4958e7b6728baba2e734196fcceeab1038",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 부모가 그를 잡아가지고 성문에 이르러 그 성읍 장로들에게 나아가서"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7888743a80550e965d2bef9820a9ce4958e7b6728baba2e734196fcceeab1038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:DEU:21:20",
      "sequence": 5468,
